     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p41-information-block",
     "replacement": "$ac+ad+bc+bd$\n\nFactorise an expression with **four terms** and no common factor to all four terms by **grouping in pairs**:\n\n1. Pair the terms.\n2. Factorise each pair separately.\n3. Take out the binomial common factor.\n\nYou may need to take out a negative factor from one pair to make the binomials match.",
